 ["Two years after the legendary 2005 final in Istanbul, Milan and Liverpool met again in the final. This time the Italians won: Filippo Inzaghi scored both Rossoneri goals (45th and 82nd minutes) and Dirk Kuyt pulled one back in the 89th.","It was the club's seventh European Cup, with Carlo Ancelotti on the Milan bench and Rafa Benítez on Liverpool's."],
